Rc8 2. a4 $1 { A useful move that gains some space, whereas Black can't undertake anything active. } ( { The natural } 2. Kf3 Rc7 3. Ke4 $6 { was less promising due to } Re7 $1 ) 
Rc7 ( { After } 2... a5 3. axb5 cxb5 4. Ra6 { White wins a pawn, although } c4 $1 5. Rxa5 cxd3 6. cxd3 Rc3 7. Rxb5 Rxd3 { may give Black greater saving chances than in the main line. } ) 
3. a5 Rc8 4. Kf3 Rc7 5. d4 $1 ( { Seeing that } 5. Ke4 $6 Re7 6. Rxe7 Kxe7 7. d4 { is successfully met by } Kd6 $1 { White adjusts his move order. } ) 
cxd4 6. Ke4 Re7 ( { Or } 6... c5 7. Rxa6 { with an easy win thanks to White's superior activity and the powerful a-pawn. } ) 
7. Rxe7+ Kxe7 8. Kxd4 Kd6 9. b4 $1 Kd7 10. Kc5 Kc7 11. c3 $1 { Creating a second zugzwang, with a quick win. } 
